---
import Section from "@/components/ui/Section.astro";
---

<Section id="about" containerClass="split">
  <div>
    <h2>What is Sadaqah Code?</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Sadaqah Code</strong> is an Islamic open-source initiative
      dedicated to building high-quality, free, and accessible digital
      tools for Muslims worldwide.
    </p>
    <p>
      We believe technology should serve people, not exploit them. Our
      mission is to create software that brings real benefit to the
      Muslim community while remaining transparent, accessible, and
      grounded in Islamic values.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="card accent">
    <h3>Why “Sadaqah Code”?</h3>
    <p>
      Sadaqah Jariyah is an ongoing charity that continues to benefit
      others. We see open-source work as one possible means of
      contributing to lasting benefit.
    </p>
    <ul class="checks">
      <li>Build useful tools that people can continue to use.</li>
      <li>
        Share knowledge that others can learn from and build upon.
      </li>
      <li>Make software open to improvement and collaboration.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="quote">Code as a means of ongoing charity.</p>
  </div>
</Section>
